e":"幽灵船长","title":"曹操_幽灵船长_移动语音1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"舍弃名字的家伙，跟挂掉没两样！","hasText":true,"duration":5.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/212/06064648BEAF91000183236333438373136.mp3"},{"id":"06098648BEAF91000183932313334313938","heroId":"212","skinId":"691","skinName":"幽灵船长","title":"曹操_幽灵船长_移动语音4","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"用宝藏来洗刷刷我的船板！","hasText":true,"duration":5.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/212/06098648BEAF91000183932313334313938.mp3"},{"id":"06184648BEAF91000183333343033363032","heroId":"212","skinId":"691","skinName":"幽灵船长","title":"曹操_幽灵船长_移动语音3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"大海贼时代降临！","hasText":true,"duration":4.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/212/06184648BEAF91000183333343033363032.mp3"},{"id":"06825648BEAF81000183933303338323038","heroId":"212","skinId":"691","skinName":"幽灵船长","title":"曹操_幽灵船长_大厅语音3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"身为著名鬼故事的男主角，值得一座金像奖。","hasText":true,"duration":7.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/212/06825648BEAF81000183933303338323038.mp3"},{"id":"06661648BEAF81000183137313235303133","heroId":"212","skinId":"691","skinName":"幽灵船长","title":"曹操_幽灵船长_大厅语音1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"扬帆！起航！","hasText":true,"duration":3.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/212/06661648BEAF81000183137313235303133.mp3"},{"id":"06232648BEAF81000183537343632313034","heroId":"212","skinId":"691","skinName":"幽灵船长","title":"曹操_幽灵船长_大厅语音2","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"我是已经成为海贼王的男人！","hasText":true,"duration":5.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/212/06232648BEAF81000183537343632313034.mp3"},{"id":"06717648BEB001000183436333739363933","heroId":"212","skinId":"695","skinName":"天狼征服者","title":"曹操_天狼征服者_技能语音3-1","category":"技能","seq":1,"text":"一触即发！","hasText":true,"duration":1.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/212/06717648BEB001000183436333739363933.mp3"},{"id":"06047648BEB001000183733383938343430","heroId":"21